msgstr "Uusi tositesarja"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_form.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_form.html:5
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_list.html:7
msgid "New fixed asset"
msgstr "Uusi käyttöomaisuushyödyke"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_form.html:6
msgid ""
"The plan applies from the month the asset is acquired, also for years before"
" the books were kept in Metra. Book the purchase itself as a voucher on the "
"asset account."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelma on voimassa hyödykkeen hankintakuukaudesta alkaen, myös ennen "
"Metra-kirjanpitoa olleilta vuosilta. Kirjaa itse hankinta tositteena "
"omaisuustilille."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_form.html:20
msgid "Remove from the register"
msgstr "Poista rekisteristä"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_list.html:10
msgid ""
"Machinery, buildings, a pipe network and other things used for more than a "
"year are booked on an asset account at their cost and depreciated by a plan."
" At year-end the plan's depreciation is offered as a voucher, and the "
"balance sheet specifications compare the register with the books."
msgstr ""
"Koneet, rakennukset, putkiverkosto ja muut yli vuoden käytettävät hyödykkeet"
" kirjataan omaisuustilille hankintamenoon ja poistetaan suunnitelman mukaan."
" Tilikauden lopussa suunnitelman mukainen poisto tarjotaan tositteena, ja "
"tase-erittelyt vertaavat rekisteriä kirjanpitoon."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_list.html:20
msgid "Acquired"
msgstr "Hankittu"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_list.html:21
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "Hankintameno"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_list.html:21
msgid "Depreciation plan"
msgstr "Poistosuunnitelma"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/asset_list.html:22
#, python-format
msgid "Depreciation %(year)s"
msgstr "Poisto %(year)s"

