msgstr "Myyty tai romutettu"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/balance_sheet.html:13
msgid ""
"The balances at the day chosen, from the posted vouchers. The profit or "
"surplus for the year is worked out from the income and expense accounts."
msgstr ""
"Saldot valittuna päivänä kirjatuista tositteista. Tilikauden voitto tai "
"ylijäämä lasketaan tuotto- ja kulutileistä."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/balance_sheet.html:17
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/income_statement.html:17
msgid "The books have not been started yet."
msgstr "Kirjanpitoa ei ole vielä aloitettu."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/budget.html:8
msgid "Edit the budget"
msgstr "Muokkaa talousarviota"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/budget.html:13
msgid ""
"The year's budget against what is booked in the period. Income and costs are"
" both positive; for a part of the year, compare with the share of the year "
"that has passed."
msgstr ""
"Vuoden talousarvio verrattuna jaksolla kirjattuun. Tuotot ja kulut ovat "
"molemmat positiivisia; vuoden osalta vertaa kuluneeseen osuuteen vuodesta."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/budget_form.html:7
msgid ""
"The income and costs expected for the whole year, per account, as positive "
"amounts. Leave an account empty for no budget."
msgstr ""
"Koko vuodelle odotetut tuotot ja kulut tileittäin positiivisina summina. "
"Jätä tili tyhjäksi, jos sillä ei ole talousarviota."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/budget_form.html:13
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/views.py:1235
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/views.py:1243
msgid "Expenses"
msgstr "Kulut"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/income_statement.html:13
msgid ""
"Income positive, expenses negative, from the posted vouchers. The previous "
"financial year is beside it for the same period."
msgstr ""
"Tuotot positiivisina, kulut negatiivisina kirjatuista tositteista. Edellinen"
" tilikausi on vieressä samalta jaksolta."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:9
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:6
