"%(count)s laskulla, suorituksella ja muistutusmaksulla ei ole vielä "
"tositetta:"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:61
msgid "Post them now"
msgstr "Kirjaa ne nyt"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:65
msgid "Set up the bookkeeping of invoices"
msgstr "Määritä laskujen kirjanpito"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:65
msgid "to book invoices, payments and reminder fees without typing."
msgstr ""
"jotta laskut, suoritukset ja muistutusmaksut kirjautuvat ilman käsin "
"kirjoittamista."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:68
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:69
msgid "Drafts to post"
msgstr "Kirjattavat luonnokset"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:70
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:71
msgid "Recently posted"
msgstr "Viimeksi kirjatut"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/invoice_panel.html:8
msgid "Draft, not posted yet"
msgstr "Luonnos, ei vielä kirjattu"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/invoice_panel.html:11
msgid "Waiting to be posted"
msgstr "Odottaa kirjaamista"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/invoice_panel.html:15
msgid ""
"Not in the books: it is dated before automatic posting started, or posting "
"is off."
msgstr ""
"Ei kirjanpidossa: se on päivätty ennen automaattisen kirjaamisen alkua tai "
"kirjaus on pois päältä."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/journal.html:12
msgid "The posted entries in date order."
msgstr "Kirjatut kirjaukset päivämääräjärjestyksessä."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/ledger.html:12
msgid ""
"The posted entries account by account. Balances are debit minus credit."
msgstr "Kirjatut kirjaukset tileittäin. Saldo on debet miinus kredit."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:7
msgid ""
"Issued invoices and credit notes (on their invoice date), payments (on the "
"day paid) and reminder fees become vouchers of their own, posted at once. "
"Each voucher points to the invoice it comes from, which is its evidence."
msgstr ""
"Annetut laskut ja hyvityslaskut (laskun päivänä), suoritukset (maksupäivänä)"
" ja muistutusmaksut muuttuvat omiksi tositteikseen, jotka kirjataan heti. "
"Jokainen tosite viittaa laskuun, josta se on peräisin ja joka toimii sen "
"todisteena."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:15
msgid "The chart of accounts lacks accounts that postings use:"
msgstr "Tilikartasta puuttuu tilejä, joita laskujen kirjanpito käyttää:"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:17
msgid "Add them"
msgstr "Lisää ne"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:23
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The receivables account is %(booked)s € when automatic posting starts, but "
"the invoices issued before then had %(open)s € outstanding. Payments of "
"those invoices are booked against the receivables account, so check the "
"opening balances."
msgstr ""
"Myyntisaamisten tilillä on %(booked)s € automaattisen kirjauksen alkaessa, "
"mutta sitä ennen laadituissa laskuissa oli avoinna %(open)s €. Näiden "
"laskujen suoritukset kirjataan myyntisaamisten tiliä vastaan, joten tarkista"
" avaavat saldot."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:36
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "Tilit"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:43
msgid "Sales accounts"
msgstr "Myyntitilit"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:44
msgid ""
"Invoice lines are booked to the account of their fee line, else to the "
"account of their VAT rate, else to the default sales account."
msgstr ""
"Laskurivit kirjataan maksurivinsä tilille, muuten ALV-kantansa tilille, "
"muuten myynnin oletustilille."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:46
msgid "Per fee line"
msgstr "Maksurivin mukaan"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/posting_settings.html:49
msgid "Per VAT rate"
